<title>HONG KONG: HK's Kwoon Chung shares debut at HK$2.30.</title>
<headline>HK's Kwoon Chung shares debut at HK$2.30.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hong Kong-based bus line operator Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.30 on the Hong Kong stock exchange on Wednesday, compared with their issue price of HK$1.80 per share.</p>
</text>
